	(text "System-5 memory card Rev F (MEM3-F), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Address        BUS BUFFERS, THE A8-A15 LATCHES AND THE BANK SELECTS\n  sheet 3  RAM lo         RAM 0000-7FFF (IC1): 74HCT151 BLOCK SELECT, JUMPERS, GATED !CE AND LED\n  sheet 4  RAM hi         RAM 8000-FFFF (IC11): 74HCT151 BLOCK SELECT, JUMPERS, GATED !CE AND LED\n  sheet 5  EPROM lo       EPROM 0000-7FFF (IC3): 74HCT151 BLOCK SELECT, JUMPERS, GATED !CE AND LED\n  sheet 6  EPROM hi       EPROM 8000-FFFF (IC5): 74HCT151 BLOCK SELECT, JUMPERS, GATED !CE AND LED\n  sheet 7  Memory         THE MEMORY CHIPS: 62256 RAM AND 27C256 EPROM OR 28C256 EEPROM, LOWER AND UPPER 32K\n  sheet 8  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, LED\n\nRedrawn 2026-11-18 from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py). Fit 74HCT151 muxes.\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "994d2506-eec9-54c4-ad1d-122a65007196"))
